---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Experience — Pedro Ivo Vasconcelos | Data Platform & AI Engineer" description="Career history and verified achievements of Pedro Ivo Vasconcelos: Playlist (formerly Mindbody) and CI&T.">
  <main id="conteudo" class="container" style="padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 5rem;">
    <div class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Professional History</p>
      <h1>Engineering Career & Proven Impact</h1>
      <p>
        Detailed track record across Data Platform Engineering, analytical data warehouse infrastructure, and reliability.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.5rem; max-width: 54rem;">
      <!-- Role 1: Playlist -->
      <article class="card" style="padding: 2.5rem;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--accent);">Current Position</span>
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.25rem;">Data Engineer</h2>
            <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--text);">Playlist (formerly Mindbody) · Data Platform Engineering</p>
          </div>
          <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-soft); background: var(--surface-soft); padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; borderRadius: 0.5rem;">
            Belo Horizonte, Brazil (Remote)
          </span>
        </div>

        <p style="color: var(--text-soft); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Responsible for architecting, evolving, and maintaining analytical data platforms supporting enterprise-wide intelligence.
        </p>

        <ul style="padding-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-soft); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <li>Designed and maintained high-throughput data ingestion pipelines connecting relational databases (SQL Server, SSIS) to modern cloud data warehouses (Snowflake, Databricks).</li>
          <li>Implemented automated pipeline health checks, schema evolution governance, and alerting for analytical reliability.</li>
          <li>Collaborated closely with cross-functional engineering, analytics, and business stakeholders to translate domain requirements into governed data models.</li>
          <li>Utilized Python, SQL, Fivetran, and cloud infrastructure on AWS for automated data replication and transformations.</li>
        </ul>

        <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span class="tag">Snowflake</span>
          <span class="tag">Databricks</span>
          <span class="tag">Python</span>
          <span class="tag">SQL</span>
          <span class="tag">Fivetran</span>
          <span class="tag">SQL Server</span>
          <span class="tag">SSIS</span>
          <span class="tag">AWS</span>
          <span class="tag">Data Reliability</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Role 2: CI&T -->
      <article class="card" style="padding: 2.5rem;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--text-soft);">Previous Track Record</span>
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.25rem;">Data Engineer / Software Engineer</h2>
            <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--text);">CI&T</p>
          </div>
          <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-soft); background: var(--surface-soft); padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; borderRadius: 0.5rem;">
            Brazil
          </span>
        </div>

        <p style="color: var(--text-soft); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Delivered high-impact data optimization and software engineering initiatives across cloud infrastructure.
        </p>

        <div style="background: var(--surface-soft); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);">
          <strong style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text);">Verified Results & Benchmarks:</strong>
          <ul style="padding-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-soft); margin: 0;">
            <li><strong>~60% Snowflake Cloud Storage Reduction:</strong> Executed an exhaustive data storage and lifecycle audit, restructuring table clustering and retention policies to cut cloud storage footprint by ~60%.</li>
            <li><strong>Up to 90% PostgreSQL Latency Reduction:</strong> Redesigned query indexing strategies, partitioned heavy historical tables, and optimized execution plans, bringing p95 query latency down to ~30 ms.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <ul style="padding-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-soft); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <li>Architected resilient data transformation workflows with Python and automated testing.</li>
          <li>Enforced software engineering best practices (unit testing, CI/CD, peer review) across data engineering deliverables.</li>
        </ul>

        <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span class="tag">Snowflake</span>
          <span class="tag">PostgreSQL Tuning</span>
          <span class="tag">Python</span>
          <span class="tag">SQL</span>
          <span class="tag">Cost Optimization</span>
          <span class="tag">CI/CD</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Role 3: Quantorin -->
      <article class="card" style="padding: 2.5rem;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--text-soft);">Technical Lab</span>
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.25rem;">Quantorin Studio & Autonomous Systems</h2>
            <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--text);">Independent AI & Systems Engineering Research</p>
          </div>
          <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-soft); background: var(--surface-soft); padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; borderRadius: 0.5rem;">
            Belo Horizonte, Brazil
          </span>
        </div>

        <p style="color: var(--text-soft); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Personal research and engineering lab focused on deterministic simulation, autonomous agents, and Model Context Protocol (MCP) server development.
        </p>

        <ul style="padding-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-soft); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <li>Engineered <strong>Quantorin AI</strong>, a Next.js 16 / Turbopack control plane and multi-agent evaluation platform.</li>
          <li>Built <strong>Work & Slop Games</strong>, a high-performance WebGL / Babylon.js 3D game platform with 259+ automated tests.</li>
          <li>Authored the <strong>CCT World Engine</strong>, a pure-Python astronomical and orbital mechanics simulator verified with 201 pytest suites.</li>
        </ul>

        <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span class="tag">Model Context Protocol (MCP)</span>
          <span class="tag">LLM Systems</span>
          <span class="tag">Babylon.js</span>
          <span class="tag">Next.js 16</span>
          <span class="tag">Python 3.12</span>
          <span class="tag">Vitest</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
